Routing rules:

- Use the assigned model whenever a team is run as a separate Codex invocation
  or delegated agent.
- If a team is executed inline by the master orchestrator, preserve the same
  evidence standard, output contract, and reasoning budget implied by the
  assigned model.
- Do not upgrade any non-orchestrator team to `gpt-5.5` unless the user
  explicitly changes this policy.
- Prefer `gpt-5.4-mini` only for classification or sentiment summarization
  stages where no order can be approved directly.

