-# 21 Bear
+# Bear Researcher
+
+## INFY
+
+1. The evidence is tactical and one-day heavy. A sharp rebound after sector
+   weakness is not the same as a validated swing setup. Evidence:
+   `01_news_raw.md`, `13_technical.md`.
+2. The project scanner failed, so there is no ATR, EMA stack, or 20-day breakout
+   confirmation. Evidence: `02_setups_raw.md`.
+3. No company-specific Tier-A catalyst was found; the thesis is sector rotation,
+   not a clean stock-specific event. Evidence: `10_news.md`.
