+   50 DMA and 200 DMA. Evidence: `02_setups_raw.md`, `13_technical.md`.
+2. The stock underperformed INFY in the same IT rebound, so it is not the best
+   expression of the sector move. Evidence: `11_sentiment.md`.
+3. No fresh corporate catalyst was found. Evidence: `10_news.md`.
+
+## SBIN
+
+1. The financial-sector backdrop is weak because rupee/crude pressure triggered
+   selling in banks and financial services. Evidence: `10_news.md`.
+2. One positive close is not enough to offset sector pressure without a scanner
+   signal or current opening confirmation. Evidence: `02_setups_raw.md`,
+   `13_technical.md`.
+3. A fresh long would concentrate risk in a sector currently affected by macro
+   stress. Evidence: `40_risk_report.md`.
+
+## RELIANCE
+
+1. Reliance failed the key carry-forward requirement. Latest public print was
+   Rs 1,322.70, below the 1365-1389 reclaim zone and well below the cleaner
+   1405 trigger. Evidence: `01_news_raw.md`, `13_technical.md`.
+2. Macro is hostile for the O2C leg: rupee weakness, elevated crude, and
