+  up Rs 54.40 / 4.76%, near the day's high of Rs 1,198.40.
+  Source: https://upstox.com/stocks/infosys-limited-share-price/
+- [tier_B] sector rotation: Infosys led the Nifty 50 gainers as the IT index
+  rallied on rupee weakness and a risk-on rotation into exporters.
