+- [tier_B] sector rotation: TCS participated in the broad IT rebound alongside
+  Infosys, HCL Tech, and Tech Mahindra.
+  Source: https://upstox.com/news/market-news/stocks/top-gainers-and-losers-may-19-kotak-mahindra-bank-titan-fall-2-infosys-surges-over-4-check-full-list/article-193962/
+
+### RELIANCE
+
+- [tier_B] price action: Reliance closed at Rs 1,322.70 on 19 May 2026 at
+  15:59 IST, down 0.99%, with day range Rs 1,318.40 to Rs 1,344.00.
+  Source: https://upstox.com/stocks/reliance-industries-ltd-share-price/
+- [memory] Prior TradeLoop context says Reliance should stay watch-only until
