# Model Routing

Use these model assignments for TradeLoop team work. The master orchestrator is
the only stage that should run on GPT-5.5 with xhigh reasoning.

| Stage | Team | Model | Reasoning |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `00_master_orchestrator.md` | Master Orchestrator | `gpt-5.5` | `xhigh` |
| `05_adhoc_intake.md` | Ad Hoc Intake | `gpt-5.4-mini` | `medium` |
| `10_news.md` | News Analyst | `gpt-5.4` | `medium` |
| `11_sentiment.md` | Sentiment Analyst | `gpt-5.4-mini` | `medium` |
| `12_fundamentals.md` | Fundamentals Analyst | `gpt-5.4` | `high` |
| `13_technical.md` | Technical Analyst | `gpt-5.4` | `high` |
| `14_shortlist.md` | Shortlister | `gpt-5.4` | `high` |
| `20_bull.md` | Bull Researcher | `gpt-5.4` | `high` |
| `21_bear.md` | Bear Researcher | `gpt-5.4` | `high` |
| `22_debate.md` | Debate Moderator | `gpt-5.4` | `xhigh` |
| `30_trade_plan.md` | Trader | `gpt-5.4` | `xhigh` |
| `40_risk_report.md` | Risk Manager | `gpt-5.4` | `xhigh` |
| `41_pm_decision.md` | Portfolio Manager | `gpt-5.4` | `xhigh` |
| `50_post_trade.md` | Post Trade Analyst | `gpt-5.4` | `high` |

Routing rules:

- Use the assigned model whenever a team is run as a separate Codex invocation
  or delegated agent.
- If a team is executed inline by the master orchestrator, preserve the same
  evidence standard, output contract, and reasoning budget implied by the
  assigned model.
- Do not upgrade any non-orchestrator team to `gpt-5.5` unless the user
  explicitly changes this policy.
- Prefer `gpt-5.4-mini` only for classification or sentiment summarization
  stages where no order can be approved directly.

